.TH MYSTRLEN 3 "September 2026" "Version 0.3.1" "MyUtils Library Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrlen \- calculate the length of a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <mystrfunctions.h>
.sp
.BI "size_t mystrlen(const char *" s ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mystrlen()
function calculates the length of the null-terminated string pointed to by
.I s
excluding the terminating null byte (\(aq\0\(aq).
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the number of bytes in the string pointed to by
.I s
.
